# Repo-root .dockerignore — core-engine and frontend both build from this
# root (see their docker-compose.yml build.context) so /shared/protos is
# reachable via a plain COPY. Neither Dockerfile does `COPY . .`; both
# whitelist specific paths, so these excludes only shrink the build context
# sent to the daemon and keep stray host build artifacts (a different-
# platform native binary, a stale bin/obj) from ever being copied in.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/bin
**/obj
**/.git
**/dist
